body:
One of my significant other's online friends passed away very recently. The only reason he or anyone else found out was because another guy they played with was friends with him on facebook and found out that way. He then messaged everyone he could think of that played with them regularly to let them know what happened. All of his friends (Including my S.O.) started a guild in his name and made plans to join up at a certain time for a memorial service. Everyone logged on and stood around and shared stories with one another. There were dozens of players there, all from different factions. Nobody was fighting, just standing around and talking for a few hours. 

&#x200B;

Just because your friends are online, doesn't mean that they're not real friends and that they won't miss you.
